  "synopsis": "Chen Nan, who has been asleep for ten thousand years, awakens in the Cemetery of Gods and Demons and becomes famous after a series of adventures. With Chen Nan's arrival in the Yangjin Kingdom and his encounter with Chen Xi, a new adventure begins: a great battle in Kaiyuan City, a search for the mystery of his origins in the Deathly Abyss, and a battle against the Ling family in pursuit of justice and clarity. In this season, Chen Nan will continue his adventure to uncover the mystery of his origins while searching for Yu Xin's whereabouts.\n\n(Source: Youku, translated)",
